    "detailed_description": "Search for hidden characters with unusual and silly behaviors in a hand-drawn, interactive scene set at the beach. These kooky characters are cleverly concealed in plain sight among others. Additionally, there are a few mini-games to challenge you and earn credits that will aid in discovering the kooky characters. To complete the game, you also have to find all 100 sunscreen bottles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n------/ Game Features /------<br />\r\n- Gameplay length = ~30 min<br />\r\n- 100+ targets to find<br />\r\n- Mini games available.<br />\r\n- Different color modes<br />\r\n- controller support<br />\r\n- 100 Achievements",
